OL,3,GNEWSAGarvaghy residents' group get
OL,4,ADrumcree resolution document from NIO
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Garvaghy Road Residents' Coalition
OL,7,F(GRRC) has held out the prospect of an
OL,8,Farrangement to resolve the Drumcree
OL,9,Fdispute after spending almost seven
OL,10,Fhours in discussions with government
OL,11,Fofficials at Hillsborough castle.
OL,13,FAsked what had been discussed, Breandan
OL,14,FMac Cionnaith said: "We received a
OL,15,Fdocument from the secretary of state,
OL,16,Fwe went through it this afternoon.
OL,18,FMac Cionnaith said he "can't divulge"
OL,19,Fwhat is in the document but added:
OL,20,F"Let's say if it's accepted by the
OL,21,FOrange Order it'll be accepted by us."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
